AC Circuit Impedance Calculator

import math

print("AC Circuit Impedance Calculator")
print("--------------------------------")

R = float(input("Enter Resistance R (Ω): "))
X = float(input("Enter Reactance X (Ω): "))

Impedance magnitude

Z = math.sqrt(R2 + X2)

Phase angle

angle = math.degrees(math.atan2(X, R))

print("Impedance =", round(Z, 2), "Ω")
print("Phase Angle =", round(angle, 2), "degrees")